-- **The pair for `Borrows`** (MS11 phase 298): `Tooling` imports `Lang` with no
-- `public`, so it keeps the language to itself and this file may not write
-- `LC` — even though the fetch puts `Lang` in the session.
rule base misseslent where

consult test.modules.Tooling

open A

rule describe LC[app]`( ${f} ${a} )` :- do
  say "an application"
